Bank Management System – README
Project Overview

This project is a Bank Management System developed in C using binary file handling and random-access file concepts. The program allows users to create, update, delete, and manage bank account records efficiently.

The system stores account information in a binary file (credit.dat) and supports transaction history management.

Features
Create new bank accounts
Deposit money
Withdraw money
Delete accounts
View account details
View transaction history
Export account records to a text file
Random-access file handling
Persistent data storage using binary files
